{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-29 09:13:00', 'title': 'TUESDAY DEADLINE REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 29, 2022) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ("SOLAREDGE" OR "THE COMPANY") (NASDAQ: SEDG) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.'}{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-29 05:45:00', 'title': 'SEDG LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , DEC. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ("SOLAREDGE" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: SEDG) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF SOLAREDGE INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD.'}{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-29 01:45:00', 'title': 'SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (SEDG) SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION ALERT: BERNSTEIN LIEBHARD LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF THE DEADLINE TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (SEDG)', 'text': 'DID YOU LOSE MONEY ON INVESTMENTS IN SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES? IF SO, PLEASE VISIT\xa0SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT OR CONTACT PETER ALLOCCO AT (212) 951-2030 OR PALLOCCO@BERNLIEB.COM TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS.'}